1795115414422759	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-29o	{"description":"Trial 2026-11-19 with a container on the host network inside playpen. Three blockers: (1) newuidmap is refused under no_new_privs, so Podman only starts with /etc/subuid and /etc/subgid hidden (single-uid mapping) and a separate image store; (2) Landlock refuses the mounts Podman and crun make, so it needs --without-landlock, which gives up the host-socket protection; (3) packet sockets are denied, so tcpdump inside the container cannot capture. With 1 and 2 worked around, unapproved sends were dropped and reported. Ideas: a Landlock mode that still permits mounts, and playpen writing its own capture of sandbox traffic from outside the command.","kind":"task","size":"m","title":"Rootless Podman does not run inside playpen without weakening it"}	blake3:1d6yxsTENJVCT-0-DlGtxz3nAfxVAtsRy9q7X2ZAJWQ
