1795199351156615	codex	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-755	{"description":"Consume the shared effective configuration and versioned plan representation from bn-6ju. Add an optional expected digest to run. Recompute and compare at the final startup decision, while still checking the live pass and expiry. Encode original argument bytes, effective grants, host mappings, socket options, labels and pass identity deterministically. Exclude clock-of-review and report destination. Verify equivalent orderings match and changed argv, grant, exposed path or pass bytes cause refusal with no child marker. Exercise review and launch through the CLI. Explain the scope and file-content limits in the README and spec.","kind":"task","labels":["ux-roadmap","approval"],"parent":"bn-204","size":"m","title":"Bind run to the versioned digest of a reviewed plan"}	blake3:hUTIRO_6Et1WoA9_gqCXJYXwuNjCpQ7SrqVk4Al2Kt8
1795199351334836	codex	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-2c0	{"description":"Maintain a small integration test for the literal README workflow and documented JSON examples. As preview, pinning and CI assertions land, cover one reviewed harmless offline run, one pre-launch refusal and one report with incomplete evidence. Validate documented fields, exit statuses and stdout separation via the public binary. Record kernel-dependent skips in qualification output and make portable examples runnable on ordinary builds. Include a spec cross-check for the fields used by external callers. Individual feature tickets still own their help and reference changes.","kind":"task","labels":["documentation","integration"],"parent":"bn-204","size":"s","title":"Exercise the published operator and agent examples against the built CLI"}	blake3:6vwEvcen_lZfC16_u9u36v4zBf5qmugmK8rAkcErsPU
