1795199391700250	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-6ju	{"field":"description","value":"Priority 2 of 10.\n\nUser outcome. A human reviews the actual command, destinations, mapped names, expiration and host socket access. An agent launches that reviewed request or learns what it needs reviewed again.\n\nEvidence. rules --format json with one allow entry returned allowed, pass and 42 lines of nft text. rules takes neither --host nor --expose. run validates those separately in src/cli.rs::check / check_exposed. Pass bytes already have a digest. The preview pattern has a useful precedent in Terraform's speculative plan: https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/cli/commands/plan .\n\nDeliver a side-effect-free plan command using the same policy and argument validation as run. Show command, pass digest/labels, canonical grants and mappings, requested hides/exposures, socket guard and deadline. Mark launch-only settings. Provide a versioned deterministic representation suitable for a later digest, with explicit ordering and original argv-byte rules. Exercise through the CLI: repeated equivalent plans agree, invalid scope or revoked pass is refused, and preview creates no rules, report, or child. Keep rules output compatible. Document text and JSON examples in docs/spec.md. Digest enforcement at launch belongs to bn-755."}	blake3:UA4_o6v-zOAGkr7UilcGIsx-TdjU5M3e7aNO-COsC1Y
