1795199391966241	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-2xw	{"field":"description","value":"A caller may safely retry some commands only when playpen can establish that the first attempt never executed. In src/sandbox.rs the parent sends GO, init watches a close-on-exec pipe, and ParentState parses status lines. Specify what observations justify definite startup refusal, confirmed execution, or an unknown outcome.\n\nExercise the production classifier against an independent outcome table. Enumerate bounded, per-writer ordered traces with partial reads, complete buffered lines, interruption, EOF and exit at different stages. A transport failure after GO alone cannot justify a definite never-started result. Cover clean execution, authoritative exec refusal and ambiguous status loss. Make an overconfident classification fail one synthetic trace. Record the bound, ordering assumptions and how to rerun. CLI/report integration belongs to bn-3aq."}	blake3:DC0ZQdtJlvQUYQ_ikhfnKJ6jTC4Mi25zFhN9GJC6cHw
