1795199392141494	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-30l	{"field":"description","value":"The original builder lacked hosts for both AppArmor restrictions and legacy terminal behavior. Track the terminal case independently. On a representative AppArmor-enforcing Linux host, record distro, kernel, effective profile and user namespace policy. Run documented doctor and a harmless offline command through the normal binary under the documented supported installation; exercise the refused configuration when available. Check the reported reason/remedy and actual child outcome, without changing a user's host protections. Update README requirements or docs/DESIGN.md if observations differ. An unavailable host keeps the scenario unqualified."}	blake3:pvqVPsHfVccTs-_OAI8zuqxDzFGV_qn6o4TuvNA8dUI
