1795199392482911	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-3up	{"field":"description","value":"The original review identified AF_VSOCK as host/kernel dependent, with no native evidence on its machine. Determine the claimed boundary from the implementation, supported kernel documentation and existing host metadata. Record what is enforced by playpen, what depends on host configuration and what is unqualified. Reconcile the README threat model and docs/spec.md with this evidence. If a stronger default is appropriate, open a separate implementation ticket with ordinary compatibility tests and a fail-closed startup criterion. Keep residual uncertainty explicit where the available evidence ends."}	blake3:EAwMu2zCjYOBtkKsVCkQd-17UCZ8F7w7VTkxTHRZJOE
