1795199392662909	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-1w3	{"field":"description","value":"kill -SIG -PGID reaches the supervisor (which forwards it) and the command directly. Predates the socket work.\n\nDefine expected delivery of one ordinary signal when targeting the foreground group versus the supervisor PID. Use a harmless signal-counting child and synchronization to distinguish one notification from two, accounting for standard signal coalescing. Check shared-group and detached-session paths in tests/terminal.rs, child exit status, interactive interruption and cleanup. Align the job-control paragraph in docs/DESIGN.md with the delivery semantics."}	blake3:czMea7jFeu7WB-CFJTU-Ub6hSMN3ywYWbtowfmT5330
